@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
ex:Person a owl:Class . ex:Employee a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ex:Person . ex:Department a owl:Class .
ex:name a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:Person ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
ex:worksIn a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:Employee ; rdfs:range ex:Department .
